{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy this to 'origin.config.json' beside the two roots (or inside either one) and edit.",
    "Everything else - where pipeline/ and ceiling-rebuild/ live - is worked out at run time",
    "from each script's own location, so only genuinely EXTERNAL paths belong here.",
    "",
    "Both keys are optional. Leaving one out keeps the built-in fallback.",
    "Either can also be overridden per-shell with an environment variable:",
    "  ORIGIN_DRYWALL_REPO   ORIGIN_INPUT_DIR",
    "",
    "Check what actually resolved on your machine with:",
    "  python -c \"ns={'__file__':'pipeline/origin_paths.py'}; exec(open(ns['__file__']).read(),ns); print(ns['describe']())\""
